{"id":189,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Jumpluff rides warm southern winds to cross the sea and fly to foreign lands. The Pokémon descends to the ground when it encounters cold air while it is floating."},{"games":["Y","Crystal"],"text":"Even in the fiercest wind, it can control its fluff to make its way to any place in the world it wants."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Blown by seasonal winds, it circles the globe, scattering cotton spores as it goes."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"Drifts on seasonal winds and spreads its cotton-like spores all over the world to make more offspring."},{"games":["HeartGold"],"text":"Once it catches the wind, it deftly controls its cotton-puff spores-- it can even float around the world."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"Once it catches the wind, it deftly controls its cotton-puff spores to float, even around the world."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"It drifts on seasonal winds and spreads its cotton-like spores all over the world to make more offspring."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"JUMPLUFF ride warm southern winds to cross the sea and fly to foreign lands. This POKéMON lands when it encounters cold air while it is floating."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Chlorophyll","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Speed stat in harsh sunlight."},{"name":"Leaf Guard","hidden":false,"description":"Prevents status conditions in harsh sunlight."},{"name":"Infiltrator","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's moves are unaffected by the target's barriers, substitutes, and the like."}],"eggGroups":["Fairy","Grass"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"grassland","color":"Blue","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":187,"name":"Hoppip","condition":null,"children":[{"id":188,"name":"Skiploom","condition":"Lv. 18","children":[{"id":189,"name":"Jumpluff","condition":"Lv